<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Workgroup cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Workgroup cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it cut its rating on Workgroup Technology Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The company said earlier on Friday that its second quarter revenues may fall below analysts' estimates and that it could register a net loss for the quarter. It said it might also have net losses in the third and fourth quarters.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 7-7/8 at 7-1/8.</p>
</text>
